COUNTRY: Malaysia
NUMBER OF DEATHS: 1
CAUSE: Caught in, between or under
ACTIVITY: Drilling, workover, well services
PRIMARY LIFE-SAVING RULE: Line of fire
NARRATIVE
A floorhand was caught between a pipe handling arm and the drill floor structure while the arm was moving. He was crushed and died despite first aid and evacuation to shore.
WHAT WENT WRONG
The floorhand entered the swing path of the pipe handler to clear a jam while the machine was still powered. The area had no physical guard and no interlock.
