Fit interlocks to the pipe handler. Define a stop and isolate procedure for clearing jams. Review all drill floor machine guarding.
CAUSAL FACTORS
PEOPLE (ACTS)
- Entered the swing path of powered equipment
- Attempted to clear jam without stopping the machine
PROCESS (CONDITIONS)
- No interlock on pipe handler
- No physical guard in swing path
- Missing procedure for clearing jams

