DATE: 28 September 2025
COUNTRY: United Kingdom
NUMBER OF DEATHS: 1
CAUSE: Confined space
ACTIVITY: Maintenance, inspection, testing
PRIMARY LIFE-SAVING RULE: Confined space
NARRATIVE
A contractor entered a process vessel for a cleaning task and collapsed. He was found by a colleague who also began to enter the vessel. The oxygen level inside the vessel was low after a purge with nitrogen.
WHAT WENT WRONG
The entry permit was issued without a gas test after the nitrogen purge. The standby person left the entry point to collect equipment.
CORRECTIVE ACTIONS AND RECOMMENDATIONS
Require a gas test immediately before entry. Prohibit standby persons from leaving the entry point. Install a physical blank on nitrogen lines.
CAUSAL FACTORS
PEOPLE (ACTS)
- Entered without atmospheric test
- Standby person left the entry point
PROCESS (CONDITIONS)
- Permit issued without gas test
- Nitrogen line not blanked
- Rescue plan not adequate

